        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "Indicates whether the Enable LWC Stacked Modals release update is enabled (true) or not (false). For orgs created before Summer ’24, the default value is false. For orgs created in Summer ’24 and later, the default value is true. This field is available in API version 61.0 and later.",
